<title>USA: Federal prosecutor ends Culbro probe.</title>
<headline>Federal prosecutor ends Culbro probe.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Culbro Corp said Wednesday it had been notified by the federal prosecutor for Connecticut that an investigation of the company has ended and no action was being taken against Culbro, its General Cigar subsidiary or any individual.</p>
<p>The probe was reported in the company's annual report to the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, Culbro said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
